Package: baresip
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: baresip-core
Replaces: baresip-core
Description: portable modular SIP user agent
 baresip is a SIP user agent with audio support, built from the upstream
 baresip and libre releases. libre is bundled as a private library.
 .
 This build is headless: it includes the SIP, TLS, SRTP/DTLS-SRTP, ICE,
 STUN/TURN, Opus, G.711, G.722, ALSA, sound-file and control (menu,
 ctrl_tcp, httpd) modules, and leaves out the GUI and video modules.
